{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18055","headline":"送进士刘师服东归 · 韩愈","name":"送进士刘师服东归","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"猛虎落槛穽，坐食如孤㹠。\n丈夫在富贵，岂必守一门。\n公心有勇气，公口有直言。\n奈何任埋没，不自求腾轩。\n仆本亦进士，颇尝究根源。\n由来骨鲠材，喜被软弱吞。\n低头受侮笑，隐忍硉兀冤。\n泥雨城东路，夏槐作云屯。\n还家虽阙短，指日亲晨飧。\n携持令名归，自足贻家尊。\n时节不可翫，亲交可攀援。\n勉来取金紫，勿久休中园。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18055.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18055","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}